Father, we thank you so much, God, for what you have done in our lives, what you are doing in our lives, Father, that we can trust you, Lord, that we are sitting under Tim's teaching and can understand what it means to be a biblical man and walk in that.

4
00:00:34.009 --> 00:00:54.635
